   | ! Oracle anchor, v1.22.0.  OPTIMIZATION AND FREQUENCIES.
   | !
   | ! Three quantities, and they are not equally comparable.
   | !
   | !   geometry    the interatomic distances.  Insensitive to the
   | !               integration grid and directly checkable.
   | !   frequencies likewise, and the more searching of the two: a
   | !               curvature is a second derivative and shows an
   | !               error a bond length absorbs.
   | !   energy      NOT asserted.  ORCA had to use defgrid3 here --
   | !               Grid5+IntAcc6 makes its Hessian fail -- and that
   | !               grid is denser than StudDFT's grid 8, which puts a
   | !               systematic 90-145 uHa between the two optimized
   | !               energies.  A tolerance wide enough to swallow that
   | !               would swallow a real failure with it, so the
   | !               difference is explained in a footnote instead.
